# Hubs agent (specialist CRM pages)

## Scope

- Hub pages: calendars, bookings, clients, profile, services
- Shared shell: `hub-shared.css` + page CSS
- Hub services for list/KPI data
- Bookings month calendar list-view on mobile (`specialist-bookings.*`)

## Coordination

- **Visual** owns global tokens and cross-page consistency.
- **Calendar Schedule** owns `/calendars/{id}/` editor, not hub list.

## DoD

- KPI/toolbars follow hub-shared patterns.
- Mobile: 2-col KPI @768, 1-col @480; bump `?v=`.
